[statement]
apk chooses the later of two versions though a requested package fails
its dependency, and refuses: `c` 2 needs `a~2`, the request installs `a`
3, and apk refuses rather than install `c` 1.

[repository]
P:c
V:2
D:a~2

P:a
V:3

P:c
V:1

[request]
a
c

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
| ERROR: unable to select packages:
|   a-3:
|     breaks: c-2[a~2]
|     satisfies: world[a]
refused
